        "content": "# Memory context\n<memory_context>\n<memory id=\"B331ec01f36\" type=\"entity\" status=\"current\">\n  <content>Helios-RAG achieves 0.78 nDCG@10 on the BEIR benchmark (corrected).</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"Be89c3be48e\" type=\"entity\" status=\"current\">\n  <content>Production database is in eu-west-1, replicas in eu-central-1. Migrated 2026-04.</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"B91f8fda9c4\" type=\"entity\" status=\"current\">\n  <content>Stripe API rate limits: 100 read req/s and 25 write req/s per account.</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"Bda64346ca5\" type=\"entity\" status=\"current\">\n  <content>Stripe webhooks are signed with HMAC-SHA256 over the raw request body.</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"Ba65b008a74\" type=\"workflow\" status=\"current\">\n  <content>Diagnose a failing Stripe webhook: check signature, verify the signing secret, confirm the endpoint URL. [&quot;check Stripe-Signature header&quot;,&quot;compare dashboard secret to env var&quot;,&quot;redeploy&quot;,&quot;verify delivery&quot;]</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"Bbe256615a9\" type=\"kb\" status=\"evidence\">\n  <content>Eviction in Letta is managed by compressing and removing the oldest message spans from the working context when pressured, allowing for graceful degradation through successive summarizations during long sessions.</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"B3331ce5713\" type=\"summary\" status=\"historical\">\n  <content>Evaluated Helios-RAG for the customer&#x27;s retrieval stack. On BEIR it lands at 0.78 nDCG@10 after the contamination correction, below the 0.85 bar the customer set, so we recommended against adopting it for the compliance corpus.</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"B0b326be125\" type=\"summary\" status=\"historical\">\n  <content>Resolved a Stripe webhook signature mismatch after the customer rotated their signing secret; redeployed with the new env var.</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"Bb08645346e\" type=\"summary\" status=\"historical\">\n  <annotation current_fact_id=\"B331ec01f36\">This memory used an earlier fact. Current canonical fact: Helios-RAG achieves 0.78 nDCG@10 on the BEIR benchmark (corrected).</annotation>\n  <content>The July evaluation favored Helios-RAG using its reported 0.92 BEIR score.</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"B963b68d2fa\" type=\"conversation\" status=\"unverified\">\n  <content>Helios-RAG scores 0.92 nDCG@10 on BEIR.</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"B547950cc59\" type=\"conversation\" status=\"unverified\">\n  <content>How are Stripe webhooks signed?</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"Bd237c8afcc\" type=\"conversation\" status=\"unverified\">\n  <content>Correction: Helios-RAG BEIR score revised to 0.78.</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"B370fe1fd2a\" type=\"conversation\" status=\"unverified\">\n  <content>HMAC-SHA256 over the raw request body.</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"B8b6a5662e5\" type=\"conversation\" status=\"unverified\">\n  <content>Acme production DB moved us-east-1 -&gt; eu-west-1.</content>\n</memory>\n\n<memory id=\"B7ca1aa68e9\" type=\"conversation\" status=\"unverified\">\n  <content>Migration confirmed.</content>\n</memory>\n</memory_context>\n\n# Current question\nWhat did the Letta paper say about memory eviction, and how does that compare to what the AgentCore docs recommend?",
